OL,3,GNEWSAClosed wedding venue seeks new
OL,4,Asuitor for #18m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade I listed country house in
OL,7,FLeicestershire which was last used as a
OL,8,Fhotel and wedding venue has gone up for
OL,9,Fsale with a guide price of #18m.
OL,11,FStapleford Park near Melton Mowbray,
OL,12,Fabruptly ceased trading in October 2024
OL,13,Fafter what the business described as
OL,14,F"adverse trading conditions".
OL,16,FWedding bookings were cancelled at
OL,17,Fshort notice and the company operating
OL,18,Fthe hotel subsequently entered
OL,19,Fliquidation with the loss of 92 jobs.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
